~ start
do SignalManager.cutscene_started.emit()
Amelia: A battery powered night light! Good, I was starting to get scared!
Theodore: Let's hurry out to the Breaker box next to it before this thing runs out of juice. 
Amelia: But what if i get too scared?
Theodore: Just keep an eye on your Fear meter. If it fills up, the darkness may become UN-BEARABLE!
do SignalManager.cutscene_ended.emit()
do GameManager.kitchen_intro = true
do SignalManager.dialogue_ended.emit()
=> END
